   :circumstances ["Youngest of five on a tenant farm in the Fylde, you came away at one-and-twenty when the holding was promised to your elder brother, and you have not gone back since, though your mother writes twice a year and you answer once." "You served part of an apprenticeship at a foundry outside Preston and left it after a quarrel with the foreman, so there are no indentures to show for those years and your work must speak for itself."]
